<section class="px-6 pb-20 md:pb-28">
  <div
    data-reveal
    class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-start gap-5 rounded-block border border-text-secondary/20 bg-bg-block-secondary px-6 py-5 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between md:px-8"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
      <svg
        width="30"
        height="30"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.4"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        class="shrink-0 text-accent"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <path d="M3 11l9-7 9 7" />
        <path d="M5 10v10h14V10" />
        <circle cx="9.5" cy="12.5" r="1.2" />
        <circle cx="14.5" cy="12.5" r="1.2" />
        <path d="M7.5 18c0-2 1-3 2-3s2 1 2 3M12.5 18c0-2 1-3 2-3s2 1 2 3" />
      </svg>
      <p class="max-w-xs text-small text-text-primary">
        Cada persona tiene un propósito y un lugar en nuestra familia, que es la iglesia.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
      <span class="text-small text-accent">¡Te esperamos!</span>
      <a
        href="/visitanos"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-accent px-5 py-2 text-small font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-bg transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03]"
      >
        Conocer más <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>